n C. by Bālakṛṣṇa Pāyaguṇḍa. Stein 72.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "राक्षसकाव्य ascribed to Kālidāsa. Ulwar 955.\n C. by Vihārimiśra. ibid.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "राक्षसकाव्य BC 487. Bd. 454. 455. IL. IO. 2238 (and\nC.). Lz. 462 (and C.).\n --ascribed to a Kālidāsa. AK 556. C. AK 556. 557.\n --attributed to Vararuci. AS p. 160.\n C. by Śambhubhāskara. Bd. 454.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "raksasotpati": [{"id": "rAkzasotpatti", "headword": "राक्षसोत्पत्ति", "headword_slp1": "rAkzasotpatti", "fold": "raksasotpati", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "राक्षसोत्पत्ति kāvya, by Nārāyaṇa Bhaṭṭa. Oppert 2685.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "raksoGnani": [{"id": "rAkzoGnAni", "headword": "राक्षोघ्नानि", "headword_slp1": "rAkzoGnAni", "fold": "raksoGnani", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "राक्षोघ्नानि vaidic verses addressed to Indra Rakṣohan.\nOxf. 398^a.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "raktapitacikitsa": [{"id": "raktapittacikitsA", "headword": "रक्तपित्तचिकित्सा", "headword_slp1": "raktapittacikitsA", "fold": "raktapitacikitsa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "aufrecht-catalogus-catalogorum", "senses": [{"gloss": "रक्तपित्तचिकित्सा med. Tb. 171.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}]}